  "correct": "1",
  "solution": "**Given : **\n\nPricipal = Rs.32400\n\nRate = 1/4 time\n\nSI = Rs. 11,664\n\n**Formula Used : **\n\nSI = (P × R × T)/100\n\n⇒ 11664 = (32400 × t × t/4)/100\n\n⇒ 11664 = 324 × t²/4\n\n⇒ t² = 144\n\n⇒ t = √144 = 12\n\n⇒ r = t/4 = 12/4 = 3%\n\n**∴ The correct answer is 3%.**",
